cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DocMeld in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "DocMeld: Lightweight document-to-agent-ready knowledge pipeline"
abstract: >-
  DocMeld converts PDF, Word, and PowerPoint documents into structured,
  agent-consumable formats through a three-stage medallion pipeline
  (Bronze → Silver → Gold) without requiring OCR, VLM, or multimodal models.
type: software
